# No trailing slash: `node_modules/` matches directories only, so a symlink
# named node_modules slips past it and gets committed. A self-referential one
# puts an infinite loop on PATH via node_modules/.bin and every bare command
# dies with ELOOP — npm exits 194 with no output. Cost two outages already.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist/
.env
.env.local
*.log
.DS_Store
coverage/
.cache/
.idea/
.vscode/
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
